                blocks: [
                    {
                        id: '242539410',
                        type: 'heading',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                level: 1,
                                textAlign: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'The Everly Brief',
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539411',
                        type: 'paragraph',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                class: 'ml-p ml-p-1',
                                textAlign: 'left',
                                footerRole: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: "This week I went deep on one question: why do some tiny newsletters feel more alive than publications with full editorial teams? I think I found the answer — and it's not what I expected.",
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539412',
                        type: 'image',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                alt: '',
                                src: 'https://assets.mlcdn.com/images/v2/templates/40/40003/the-everly-brief.jpg',
                                url: '',
                                width: 2988,
                                height: 1992,
                                linkId: null,
                                caption: 'A quiet desk, a blank page, and the question every writer eventually asks: who am I actually writing this for?',
                                linkType: 'link',
                                alignment: 'center',
                                fullWidth: false,
                                footerRole: null,
                                openNewTab: false,
                            },
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539413',
                        type: 'heading',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                level: 2,
                                textAlign: 'left',
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'The Deep Dive',
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539414',
                        type: 'paragraph',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                class: 'ml-p ml-p-1',
                                textAlign: 'left',
                                footerRole: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'Most advice about newsletter writing focuses on tactics — subject lines, send times, content length. But the writers with the most loyal audiences tend to share one quiet habit that has nothing to do with any of that.',
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539415',
                        type: 'heading',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                level: 3,
                                textAlign: 'left',
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'The quiet advantage of writing to one person',
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539416',
                        type: 'paragraph',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                class: 'ml-p ml-p-1',
                                textAlign: 'left',
                                footerRole: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: "The best newsletters don't feel like broadcasts. They feel like a message from a friend who happens to know a lot. This piece breaks down the specific writing habits that create that intimacy — and how to build them into your own process.",
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539417',
                        type: 'divider',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                size: 1,
                                color: null,
                                style: 'solid',
                                width: '100%',
                                alignment: 'center',
                            },
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539418',
                        type: 'heading',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                level: 2,
                                textAlign: 'left',
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'Worth Bookmarking',
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539419',
                        type: 'paragraph',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                class: 'ml-p ml-p-1',
                                textAlign: 'left',
                                footerRole: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'The 2-minute inbox audit',
                                    type: 'text',
                                    marks: [
                                        {
                                            type: 'bold',
                                        },
                                    ],
                                },
                                {
                                    text: ' — Scan your last 10 emails. Which ones did you open immediately? Which did you skip? The pattern tells you everything about your subject lines.',
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539420',
                        type: 'paragraph',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                class: 'ml-p ml-p-1',
                                textAlign: 'left',
                                footerRole: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'Why "valuable content" is bad advice',
                                    type: 'text',
                                    marks: [
                                        {
                                            type: 'bold',
                                        },
                                    ],
                                },
                                {
                                    text: " — Everyone says it. Nobody defines it. This essay finally does — and the answer is more specific than you'd think.",
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539421',
                        type: 'paragraph',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                class: 'ml-p ml-p-1',
                                textAlign: 'left',
                                footerRole: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'How Lenny Rachitsky built to 700k subscribers',
                                    type: 'text',
                                    marks: [
                                        {
                                            type: 'bold',
                                        },
                                    ],
                                },
                                {
                                    text: ' — This is the one I mentioned above. One decision early on changed everything. Worth reading slowly.',
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539422',
                        type: 'divider',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                size: 1,
                                color: null,
                                style: 'solid',
                                width: '100%',
                                alignment: 'center',
                            },
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539423',
                        type: 'heading',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                level: 2,
                                textAlign: 'left',
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'Enjoyed this issue?',
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539424',
                        type: 'paragraph',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                class: 'ml-p ml-p-1',
                                textAlign: 'left',
                                footerRole: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: "I have been writing The Everly Brief for three years — every week, no exceptions. No ads, no sponsors, no fluff. Just the most interesting things she found, written the way she'd explain them to a friend over coffee. If this issue resonated, there are 150 more in the archive — and a new one lands every Tuesday.",
                                    type: 'text',
                                },
                            ],
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        id: '242539425',
                        type: 'button',
                        editor_content: {
                            attrs: {
                                url: '',
                                size: 'medium',
                                type: 'primary',
                                width: 'auto',
                                linkId: 103,
                                linkType: 'link',
                                alignment: 'center',
                                textColor: null,
                                openNewTab: false,
                                backgroundColor: null,
                            },
                            content: [
                                {
                                    text: 'If you enjoyed this issue, pass it along',
                                    type: 'text',
